OL,3,CWhat can scientists learn from SpaceX
OL,4,Crocket crashing into the moon?
OL,6,FA four-tonne SpaceX rocket traveling
OL,7,Fat seven times the speed of sound
OL,8,Funintentionally collided with the moon
OL,9,Fon Wednesday morning, scientists have
OL,10,Fconfirmed.
OL,12,FAs predicted, the impact occurred at
OL,13,F7:35am BST on Wednesday, Carl Schmidt,
OL,14,Fplanetary scientist at Boston
OL,15,FUniversity's Center for Space Physics,
OL,16,Ftold ITV News.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
