OL,3,CWhat can scientists learn from SpaceX
OL,4,Crocket crashing into the moon?
OL,6,FBut how did this unplanned collision
OL,7,Fhappen, and what concerns do experts
OL,8,Fhave about the impact?
OL,10,FITV News explains.
OL,12,FWhy did the rocket crash into the moon?
OL,14,FThe Falcon 9 rocket lifted off from
OL,15,FFlorida in January last year, carrying
OL,16,Ftwo commercial lunar landers.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
