OL,3,CWhat can scientists learn from SpaceX
OL,4,Crocket crashing into the moon?
OL,6,FOne of them, Firefly Aerospace's Blue
OL,7,FGhost, became the first private
OL,8,Fspacecraft to pull off a fully
OL,9,Fsuccessful lunar touchdown. The other,
OL,10,FJapan-based ispace's lander, wrecked.
OL,12,FFalcon 9 consisted of two stages. The
OL,13,Ffirst, a reusable booster used for
OL,14,Flift-off, returned to earth for future
OL,15,Fmissions.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/17
