OL,3,CWhat can scientists learn from SpaceX
OL,4,Crocket crashing into the moon?
OL,6,FIndependent astronomers were the first
OL,7,Fto identify the trajectory using
OL,8,Fpublicly available data, before Nasa
OL,9,Flater confirmed that the stage had an
OL,10,F100% chance of hitting the moon.
OL,12,FHas anything like this happened before?
OL,14,FThe moon is struck by meteoroids
OL,15,Feveryday, since it has no atmosphere
OL,16,Fto slow the movements of objects
OL,17,Fcoming towards it.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/17
