PN,31708
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1786020504
OL,3,CWhat can scientists learn from SpaceX
OL,4,Crocket crashing into the moon?
OL,6,FThere have also been recent incidents
OL,7,Fof rockets aiming to land on the moon,
OL,8,Fbut crashing to its surface instead.
OL,10,FDid the crash pose any danger to Earth?
OL,12,FNo. Nasa said that the impact posed no
OL,13,Fdanger to Earth.
OL,15,FWhat about the impact on the moon?
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
