PN,31717
SC,0017
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1786020504
OL,3,CWhat can scientists learn from SpaceX
OL,4,Crocket crashing into the moon?
OL,6,FThe UK Space Agency is a member of the
OL,7,FInter-Agency Space Debris Coordination
OL,8,FCommittee (IADC), which said: "Space
OL,9,Fdebris is a growing challenge, which
OL,10,Fis why the National Space Operations
OL,11,FCentre tracks around 30,000 threats,
OL,12,Frisks and hazards in orbit every year.
OL,14,F"We're also taking action to clean up
OL,15,Fspace now, spending over #85 million
OL,16,Fon our ability to track potential
OL,17,Fthreats in orbit, and developing the
OL,18,Fcutting-edge tech which will allow us
OL,19,Fto service satellites while in space."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G17/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
